---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="MISC" active="/misc" description="guides, nextdns configs, ad-block setup, and software license keys.">
    <section class="post">
        <div class="title">GUIDES</div>
        <div class="entry">
            <details>
                <summary>Ad Blocking</summary>
                <div class="details-content">
                    <p>Browsers: install <a href="https://ublockorigin.com/">uBlock Origin</a> or <a href="https://github.com/uBlockOrigin/uBOL-home">uBO Lite</a>
                    <br>iOS: install <a href="https://adguard.com/en/adguard-ios/overview.html?source=ag_products_page">AdGuard</a>
                    <br>All Devices: use a DNS blocker like NextDNS. You can find mine below. It blocks requests before they get on your device.</p>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details>
                <summary>Cracked Spotify</summary>
                <div class="details-content">
                    <p>Android: install <a href="https://github.com/Team-xManager/xManager">xManager</a>
                    <br>iOS: <a href="https://sideload.wiki">sideload</a> <a href="https://spotc.yodaluca.dev/">SpotC++</a>
                    <br>Windows: install <a href="https://github.com/SpotX-Official/SpotX">SpotX</a>
                    <br>Linux/Mac: install <a href="https://github.com/SpotX-Official/SpotX-Bash">SpotX Bash</a>
                    <br>Browser: Follow the guide above</p>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details>
                <summary>NextDNS Setup Instructions</summary>
                <div class="details-content">
                    <p>No logs, unlimited queries, iOS Revoke protection. code <span class="highlightable" data-copy="7af1b9">7af1b9<span class="copy-feedback">COPIED</span></span></p>
                    <label for="device-select" style="font-size:10px;display:block;margin:6px 0 4px;">Select your device:</label>
                    <select id="device-select">
                        <option value="">&gt; Select a device</option>
                        <option value="android">Android</option>
                        <option value="ios">iOS</option>
                        <option value="windows">Windows</option>
                        <option value="macos">macOS</option>
                        <option value="linux">Linux</option>
                        <option value="chromeos">ChromeOS</option>
                        <option value="browsers">Browsers</option>
                        <option value="routers">NextDNS for Routers</option>
                        <option value="pfsense">pfSense</option>
                        <option value="mikrotik">MikroTik</option>
                    </select>
                    <div id="instructions" style="margin-top:8px;"></div>
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>
    </section>

